                <mxCell id="63" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;ECS:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Has a public elastic ipv4 address that maps to 2 domain names&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Security Group allows traffic from all ips only for port 443 (https) and only my personal IP Address for port 22&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-Nginx to load balance, terminate tsl certificate and route traffic between backend and nexjs backend for frontend&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="620" width="620" height="70" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="64" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;RDS:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Runs the PostgreSQL DBs for the Apps&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-Securtity Group only allows traffic from the EC2 Instance&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="720" width="330" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="65" value="&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Elasticache for Redis:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Runs Redis Cache for the Apps&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30); color: rgb(192, 192, 192);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;-Security Group only allows traffic from the EC2 Instance&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="5" y="780" width="320" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="66" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;S3:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Holds the stored Images&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Cant do static Hosting since nextjs ssr doesnt support static files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="840" width="370" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
